msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Opgradering"

msgid "This page proposes to upgrade your database corresponding to your old version of Piwigo to the current version. The upgrade assistant thinks you are currently running a <strong>release %s</strong> (or equivalent)."
msgstr "Hierdie blad se doel is om die Piwigo databasis van 'n ou na nuwer weergawe te opgradeer. Die opgraderingassistent dink jy gebruik tans <strong>weergawe %s</strong> (of ekwivalent)."

msgid "Upgrade from version %s to %s"
msgstr "Opgradeer van weergawe %s na %s"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistiek"

msgid "total upgrade time"
msgstr "totale opgraderingstyd"

msgid "total SQL time"
msgstr "totale SQL tyd"

msgid "SQL queries"
msgstr "SQL navrae"

msgid "Upgrade informations"
msgstr "Opgraderingsinligting"

msgid "Perform a maintenance check in [Administration>Tools>Maintenance] if you encounter any problem."
msgstr "Doen 'n instandhoudingsondersoek by [Administrasie>Werktuie>Instandhouding] indien jy enige probleme ondervind."

msgid "As a precaution, following plugins have been deactivated. You must check for plugins upgrade before reactiving them:"
msgstr "As voorsorg is die volgende invoegings gedeaktiveer. Voor heraktivering moet jy eers vir opgraderings soek:"

msgid "Only administrator can run upgrade: please sign in below."
msgstr "Net die administrateur kan opgraderings doen: teken hier onder aan."

msgid "You do not have access rights to run upgrade"
msgstr "Jy het nie toegangsregte op 'n opgradering te doen nie"

msgid "All sub-albums of private albums become private"
msgstr "Alle onderalbums van privaat albums word ook privaat"

msgid "User permissions and group permissions have been erased"
msgstr "Gebruiker en groepregte is uitgevee"

msgid "Only thumbnails prefix and webmaster mail address have been saved from previous configuration"
msgstr "Slegs duimnaels en webmeester se pos adres is uit die vorige opstelling behou"

msgid "In <i>%s</i>, before <b>?></b>, insert:"
msgstr "In <i>%s</i>, voor <b>?></b>, voeg in:"

msgid "As a precaution, following themes have been deactivated. You must check for themes upgrade before reactiving them:"
msgstr "As voorsorg is die volgende temas gedeaktiveer. Voor heraktivering moet jy eers vir opgraderings soek:"

